# Mutation Testing — L3 Hard Gate

Enforces INV-30: tests must have genuine fault-detection power (85% mutation score).

## Per-Stack Setup

<% if (language === 'java' && buildTool === 'gradle') { %>
### Java (Gradle)

`gradle/pitest.gradle` has been generated. Add to your `build.gradle`:

```groovy
apply from: 'gradle/pitest.gradle'
```

Run: `./gradlew pitest`
<% } %><% if (language === 'java' && buildTool === 'maven') { %>
### Java (Maven)

See `docs/mutation/pitest-maven-setup.md` for the `<plugin>` block to add to `pom.xml`.

Run: `mvn verify -Ppitest`
<% } %><% if (language === 'typescript') { %>
### TypeScript

Install peer deps:

```bash
npm i -D @stryker-mutator/core @stryker-mutator/vitest-runner
```

`stryker.conf.json` has been generated at the project root.

Run: `npx stryker run`
<% } %><% if (language === 'rust') { %>
### Rust (beta — requires `--accept-beta-tools`)

Install cargo-mutants:

```bash
cargo install cargo-mutants
```

`cargo-mutants.toml` and `scripts/parse-mutants.mjs` have been generated.

Run: `cargo mutants --config cargo-mutants.toml 2>&1 | node scripts/parse-mutants.mjs --threshold <%= mutationThreshold %>`
<% } %><% if (language === 'python') { %>
### Python (beta — requires `--accept-beta-tools`)

Install mutmut:

```bash
pip install mutmut
```

`mutmut-config.toml` and `scripts/parse-mutmut.py` have been generated.

Run: `mutmut run && python scripts/parse-mutmut.py --threshold <%= mutationThreshold %>`
<% } %>

## Threshold

**<%= mutationThreshold %>% mutation score** required. Enforced by `node scripts/check-all.mjs L2`.

## Disabling

Lower governance to L2 (`arbiter init --level=L2`) to revert to advisory-only mutation guidance.
